/*!
\mainpage ISCE3 - InSAR Scientific Computing Environment

\tableofcontents

<table border="0" cellspacing="4" cellpadding="4">

<tr><td>
ISCE3 is a Synthetic Aperture Radar (SAR) processing library on which data processing workflows for the <a href="http://nisar.jpl.nasa.gov">NISAR</a> mission is built. ISCE3 is released under the Apache 2.0 license.
As a library, it provides a variety of data structures (C++/ Python) that are used frequently in SAR/ InSAR data processing. ISCE3 also comes with a variety of useful data processing pipelines for SAR data processing.</td>
</tr>

Public Repository: <a href="https://github.com/isce-framework/isce3">GitHub</a><br>
JPL Repository: <a href="https://github-fn.jpl.nasa.gov/isce-3/isce">JPL-internal GitHub-FN</a><br>

The public repository is expected to lag behind the JPL version for the time being.

